Package: ivfamily
Type: Package
Title: Instrumental Variables Family for jamovi
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mingchao Sun
Maintainer: Mingchao Sun <mingchao.sun@hotmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/ivfamily
BugReports: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/ivfamily/issues
Description: Instrumental-variable analyses for jamovi: two-stage least squares, LIML, Fuller
    and k-class estimators and two-step GMM with classical, robust and cluster-robust
    standard errors and absorbed fixed effects, with first-stage and weak-instrument
    diagnostics, overidentification tests and weak-instrument-robust inference.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jmvcore (>= 2.3.4),
    R6,
    ggplot2
